    "sections": {
        "description": "Mediora is a responsive Full Site Editing medical WordPress theme for healthcare websites, hospitals, clinics, doctors, dentists, pharmacies, wellness centers, therapists, health coaches, and professional health service providers. This block theme includes ready-made patterns for a medical homepage, hero banner, services, departments, testimonials, FAQ, latest news, call to action, header, footer, sidebar, archive, and single post layouts. With clean templates, global styles, wide blocks, and Site Editor customization, Mediora helps you build a fast, accessible, mobile-friendly healthcare website without code."
